    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Your body forms a connection to the Shadow Plane, allowing you to teleport through it, rather than the Astral Plane, with ease. While this spell is active, as a move action, you can teleport to any area of dim light or darkness you can see within range. If you leave a threatened space, you have concealment (20% miss chance) against any foe that makes an attack of opportunity against you.</p>"
